book a huge  disservice Paramount removed the film  from its release schedule just weeks  before it was due to hit Cinemas in 2015  with no explanation a source close to  the production told The Hollywood  Reporter that the delay was due to the  visual effects being incomplete and that  the movie would drop in a few mums  however years would pass before it saw  the light of day and when that  eventually happened it was easy to see  why it was hidden away for so long the  big stars chew the scenery as the film  meanders to an unsatisfying finish  Sony's Spider-Man universe has included  the financially successful and  critically moderately received Venom and  Venom Let There Be Carnage and in 2022  the latest entry morbius hit theaters  earning some of the worst reviews for  film based on a Comics property in more  than a decade An Origin story of the  titular living vampire morbius Stars  Jared Leto as Michael morbius a  scientist who cures himself of a blood  disorder with an experimental treatment  of his own design of course he also  accidentally makes himself a special  kind of vampire one who feasts on the  blood of humans but who also has  superpowers these Powers fuel his epic  battle for the ages against Milo morbius  his surrogate brother who has the same  blood disease contracts the same Powers  but becomes the Monstrous vampire  counterpart to Michael Stark heroism  let's have some fun  according to professional film critics  morbius is the worst film yet in Sony's  Spider-Man adjacent Cinematic Universe  scoring a lowly 16 on Rotten Tomatoes  [Music]
 

